      "usn": -1,
      "tags": " av002 fixture::new-2 profile::limits state::new ",
      "flds": "Reverse the sequence red, blue, green.\u001fGreen, blue, red.\u001fGreen first\nBlue second\nRed last\u001fGreen blue red\u001fen-US\u001fReversing changes the order, not the items.",
