      "guid": "B$EVw?pKJY",
      "mid": 1789519238847,
      "mod": 1789519238,
      "usn": -1,
      "tags": " av002 fixture::review-1 profile::limits state::mature ",
      "flds": "In a game, a token is valid only if it is blue and square. A token is blue and round. Is it valid, and why?\u001fNo. It is blue but not square, and both conditions are required.\u001fIt is not valid\nIt fails the square requirement\u001fNo, because it is round instead of square.\u001fen-US\u001fMeeting just one required condition is insufficient.",
      "sfld": "In a game, a token is valid only if it is blue and square. A token is blue and round. Is it valid, and why?",
